<http://data.silknow.org/object/6ef42b55-604a-3409-96bd-e8ac688d46fc>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of silk satin with silk and metal threads, Iran, 1830-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of silk satin with silk and metal threads.\n\nWoven silk and metal thread, satin ground.\nWarp: blue, pink and white silk, all indeterminable twist. \nWeft: light green, pink [possibly three shades], beige and light blue silk, all indeterminable twist and yellow silk, S-twist.\nMetal thread: silver strip open S-wound on light pink silk. The metal thread can be glimpsed in places on the back.\nTriangular shape. Striped pattern:\n[1] dark blue ground with a small, delicate flowering plant in at least two variations in light blue, pink and light green all edged in yellow.\n[2] white ground with a dense but delicate meander in beige and light green, bearing full blossoms in light pink alternating with a rosette in light blue and pink.\nBoth stripes are bordered with narrow dark blue and pink stripes."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/dd204cc1-12dd-30ba-871d-e2fc9b980bcf> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of silk satin with silk and metal threads.\n\nWoven silk and metal thread, satin ground.\nWarp: blue, pink and white silk, all indeterminable twist. \nWeft: light green, pink [possibly three shades], beige and light blue silk, all indeterminable twist and yellow silk, S-twist.\nMetal thread: silver strip open S-wound on light pink silk. The metal thread can be glimpsed in places on the back.\nTriangular shape. Striped pattern:\n[1] dark blue ground with a small, delicate flowering plant in at least two variations in light blue, pink and light green all edged in yellow.\n[2] white ground with a dense but delicate meander in beige and light green, bearing full blossoms in light pink alternating with a rosette in light blue and pink.\nBoth stripes are bordered with narrow dark blue and pink stripes."@en , "Dress fabric of silk satin with silk and metal threads, Iran, 1830-1899"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/6ef42b55-604a-3409-96bd-e8ac688d46fc/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/6ef42b55-604a-3409-96bd-e8ac688d46fc/dimension/1> ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.21:56-1955" ;
